  { rt_cpuinit, at boot (1.0.124): what the processor has, into
    rt_cpufeat for CpuHas, with the bits pasast's CpuFeatBit names.
    cpuid 1 (ecx), 7 (ebx, ecx) and 0x80000001 (ecx); the AVX features
    count only when the kernel saves the ymm registers (XCR0 bits 1 and
    2, edi), the AVX-512 ones only when it saves the zmm ones too (bits
    5 to 7, esi), as Go's cpu package does. Then the time-stamp counter
    and the monotonic clock, from which CycleFreq works out the rate. }
