    Go's lock on arm64: a plain ldxr/stxr pair and a plain store order
    nothing, and the critical section could leak on real hardware. }
  { Go's lock_futex on arm64 as on amd64 (P98): four rounds of thirty
    yields, one sched_yield, then futex on the word with 2 in it. x0
    stays the lock; x8 to x12 change. }
